Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Agent body: find and tell; replies from an old scene are
 discarded

- /agentpath find <x> <y> <radius> <text>: the server's object search for
  bot accounts, nearest first (30 at most), including objects inside
  buildings (with cell, cell-local position and building). Squad bots use
  it for starport terminals and hospitals.
- /agentpath path replies carry the leash's proof for the route.
- Body: find and tell commands; a scene generation counter, so helper
  replies and walks started before a zone change return scene_changed
  instead of acting in the new scene (C4d F3). Sends happen under the
  world mutex.

Agent: Claude
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
